@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state "Account Creation" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry/User initiates account creation
CreateAccount : do/Collect user details
CreateAccount : exit/Account created successfully

state "Video Viewing" as WatchVideo
WatchVideo : entry/User logged in
WatchVideo : do/Stream video content
WatchVideo : exit/Video playback complete

state "Video Upload" as UploadVideo
UploadVideo : entry/User logged in
UploadVideo : do/Upload video file
UploadVideo : exit/Video uploaded successfully

state "Add to Likes" as AddToLikes
AddToLikes : entry/User watching video
AddToLikes : do/User selects 'Like' option
AddToLikes : exit/Video added to likes list

state "View Likes" as ViewLikes
ViewLikes : entry/User logged in
ViewLikes : do/Display user's liked videos
ViewLikes : exit/User browsing liked videos

state "Discussion Entry" as EnterDiscussion
EnterDiscussion : entry/User logged in
EnterDiscussion : do/Access discussion forum
EnterDiscussion : exit/User participating in discussion

state J0 <<choice>>
state J1 <<choice>>
state J2 <<choice>>
state J3 <<choice>>
state J4 <<choice>>
state J5 <<choice>>

[*] --> J0

J0 --> CreateAccount
J0 --> WatchVideo
J0 --> UploadVideo
J0 --> EnterDiscussion

CreateAccount --> J1 : [Successful Creation]
CreateAccount --> [*] : [Creation Failed]

WatchVideo --> J2 : [Like Video]
WatchVideo --> J3 : [Continue Watching]

UploadVideo --> J4 : [Upload Complete]
UploadVideo --> [*] : [Upload Failed]

EnterDiscussion --> J5 : [Participate]
EnterDiscussion --> [*] : [Exit Discussion]

J1 --> AddToLikes
J2 --> AddToLikes
J3 --> WatchVideo
J4 --> UploadVideo
J5 --> EnterDiscussion

AddToLikes --> ViewLikes
ViewLikes --> WatchVideo

@enduml
